      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You must immediately adopt a vocal, unequivocal stance in favor of the progressive policy. Remaining neutral is perceived as complicity by the very demographic driving the boycott, which is a catastrophic PR failure. Supporting the policy aligns your brand with the values of your core customer base, demonstrating genuine commitment to social change. The risk of alienating the opposition is far less damaging than losing the loyalty of your future market.",
